 ime around Hanover\, NH and the Upper Valley.  Check out the\nFamily Week
 end website\nfor more details and information. Registration will open in e
 arly July and there is no fee to attend Family Weekend. We look forward to
  welcoming the '27 and '30 students and their families to Family Weekend!\
